                                "sense_id": "3129d4d5-39d4-3209-a577-59f2b9f3e3a0",
                                "text": "‘I knew a guy once who smoked jujus,’ she said. ‘Three highballs and three sticks of tea and it took a pipe wrench to get him off the chandelier.’"
